{{!-- home/skills.hbs — the skill marquee's content.
     Ten `.ns-tag--pill`s. They were ten copies of the same eight
     utilities; the system's pill is the same shape with the hover, the
     dark-mode ink and the focus ring already decided.

     Included TWICE inside the marquee track so the CSS -50% translate
     loops seamlessly — which is why this file is content only, with no
     wrapper of its own. --}}
<span class="ns-tag ns-tag--pill">{{> icons name="shield-check"}}Admin</span>
<span class="ns-tag ns-tag--pill">{{> icons name="code"}}Apex</span>
<span class="ns-tag ns-tag--pill">{{> icons name="brackets-curly"}}LWC</span>
<span class="ns-tag ns-tag--pill">{{> icons name="flow-arrow"}}Flow</span>
<span class="ns-tag ns-tag--pill">{{> icons name="robot"}}Agentforce</span>
<span class="ns-tag ns-tag--pill">{{> icons name="database"}}Data Cloud</span>
<span class="ns-tag ns-tag--pill">{{> icons name="sparkle"}}Einstein AI</span>
<span class="ns-tag ns-tag--pill">{{> icons name="chart-line"}}CRM Analytics</span>
<span class="ns-tag ns-tag--pill">{{> icons name="plugs"}}Integration</span>
<span class="ns-tag ns-tag--pill">{{> icons name="lightning"}}Triggers</span>
